🚀 Installation & Setup Guide

### 1. Prerequisites
* Wazuh Manager 4.x running (Docker or Bare-Metal)
* Groq API Key ([Get API Key](https://console.groq.com/))
* Python 3.x installed inside the Wazuh environment

### 2. Integration Script Placement
Copy `custom-ollama-triage.py` to your Wazuh Manager integrations directory and set correct permissions:

```bash
cp custom-ollama-triage.py /var/ossec/integrations/custom-ollama-triage.py
chmod 750 /var/ossec/integrations/custom-ollama-triage.py
chown root:wazuh /var/ossec/integrations/custom-ollama-triage.py


### 3. Wazuh Configuration (`/var/ossec/etc/ossec.conf`)
Add the following integration block inside the `<ossec_config>` root tag:

```xml
<integration>
  <name>custom-ollama-triage.py</name>
  <hook_url>[https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions](https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions)</hook_url>
  <api_key>YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY_HERE</api_key>
  <level>7</level>
  <alert_format>json</alert_format>
</integration>

4. Restart Wazuh Manager

/var/ossec/bin/wazuh-control restart
# Or via Docker:
# docker restart single-node-wazuh.manager-1

